        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SNmcdAtw4ombFBx6S1KlOKeSgwe\"><em><strong>The graph shows oil production capacity for several </strong><strong>Gulf</strong><strong> countries between 1990 and 2010. Summarize the key information by highlighting the main features and make appropriate comparisons</strong><strong> where relevant</strong><strong>.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Oil Production Capacity in Gulf Countries: 1990&ndash;2010</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề + Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GSfZdFZOWo4qLSxeFS1lCO9Wggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JPpTdOky0o45Jxx6Vw0lN8Ckgdl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KH1odyFW4oIbcSxPOsmlV1bEg1g\">Đề b&agrave;i Oil Production Capacity in Gulf Countries: 1990&ndash;2010 y&ecirc;u cầu chung ta m&ocirc; tả biểu đồ cột so s&aacute;nh c&ocirc;ng suất sản xuất dầu của s&aacute;u quốc gia Trung Đ&ocirc;ng trong c&aacute;c năm 1990, 2000, 2005 v&agrave; 2010.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AENmd32dPoMrGZxIEABlAuMdgLc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-El90duJV1oc7FSxkMP9lgvB2gMc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CgDDdvXkGo8dx7x4l2MlUUHqgoc\">Với dạng line graph (số liệu c&oacute; thay đổi theo thời gian), ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh cần đề cập c&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng tin sau trong Overview:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OzCndgkIvoiWyOxtDs8l7oLqglh\"><strong>+ [Trend - tăng/giảm/kh&ocirc;ng đổi]:</strong> ngoại trừ Qatar, tất cả c&aacute;c quốc gia đều tăng gia sản xuất qua c&aacute;c năm.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B5SkdaTrooZDQdxnd9ml0fNwgnf\"><strong>+ [So s&aacute;nh - lớn nhất/ nhỏ nhất/ thay đổi nhiều nhất]: </strong>Saudi Arabia l&agrave; nh&agrave; sản xuất lớn nhất, trong khi Qatar ở mức thấp nhất.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B5SkdaTrooZDQdxnd9ml0fNwgnf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng ph&acirc;n chia 2 đoạn BODY</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KEbNd18N4ojAdxx5thflzyGzgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GjlKdTAFYotAH4xPyJTlzajigSd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K3PcdlCjjoD0QwxT0GZlNsjPgkb\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K3PcdlCjjoD0QwxT0GZlNsjPgkb\">Ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh chọn chia phần th&acirc;n b&agrave;i đề Oil Production Capacity in Gulf Countries: 1990&ndash;2010 <em>theo quốc gia, với ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; lượng sản xuất cao thấp:</em></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K1xLdmpzJo5GFtxZkDOlcChwgSb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[BODY 1 - những nước sản xuất nhiều nhất]:</strong> Saudia Aribia v&agrave; Iran</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HLQXd3mN8oVHnmxn62HlGc1Ngyg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[BODY 2 - những nước c&ograve;n lại]: </strong>Iraq, Kuwait, UAE, Qatar</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Định hướng sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong từng BODY</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YWd1dsUwQoILZ1xijNxlMAK4gNP\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G329dRKrdoXJBtxdtUPlH4Kzgqb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WsWEdjLKkovk8fxKBk8l5ox8g2d\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>[BODY 1]</strong>: N<strong>hững nước sản xuất nhiều nhất</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RJqxdgUw6opqPqx6VEilXfnjg6w\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>số liệu của Saudi Arabia</strong> <em>(8 million v&agrave;o năm đầu, sau đ&oacute; tăng 5 năm sau, rồi tiếp tục tăng đến 14 million v&agrave;o năm 2010).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AdqXdtaoBob7MCxy2UKlj511gSg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh với Iran</strong> <em>(l&agrave; nh&agrave; sản xuất đứng thứ nh&igrave; - số liệu tăng tương đối đều).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gr8KdNROmoH5C5xn78plEuDOgTf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>số liệu của Iran</strong> <em>(3 million v&agrave;o năm đầu, sau đ&oacute; tăng l&ecirc;n 4 million từ năm 2000 đến 2010).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M8hidUa93oWG6KxC7zmlwSkHgeg\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VtU1dmlQxooIsbxTqK7lst1pgCb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>[BODY 2]</strong>: <strong>Những nước c&ograve;n lại</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MLSudK5GXok4TBxvbHPlllx7gkf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>số liệu của Iraq, Kuwait, UAE</strong> <em>(đều xuất ph&aacute;t ở mức 2 million v&agrave;o năm đầu, sau đ&oacute; tăng gấp đ&ocirc;i v&agrave;o năm cuối)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TgT3dVlFEohrzYx1LPblP3qrgHd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>số liệu của Qatar</strong> <em>(số liệu kh&ocirc;ng đ&aacute;ng kể, hầu như ở mức 0.5 million trong suốt thời kỳ)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Định hướng về cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C&aacute;c bạn c&oacute; thể tham khảo cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u sau đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\n<table class=\"ace-table\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"170;208;345\"><colgroup><col width=\"170\"><col width=\"208\"><col width=\"345\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WSjydjDq2oU4nuxVN5nlt3y8gmc\"><strong>Chức năng</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQFld4TJrohtxcxHD82lgHRTgOg\"><strong>Cấu tr&uacute;c</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZPaadE3L2oaDZZxIQiPlZTVBgkf\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ</strong></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PnCidpk6ToaDFCxChOSl0x25gug\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng với động từ</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QlJRdCuZ2oLmBFxG9ekl6LAegFg\">V + ADV</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fz30d3maLot8h6xrK1nlP9f4glh\">Saudi Arabia delivered exactly 8 million barrels a day in 1990, and this figure <strong>rose moderately</strong> over the next 5 years.</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JJRadHKryorLbKxMAErlpQwwghe\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng kh&ocirc;ng đổi</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OJXKdLrQJo3ERvxhB6Tl6PKHgQh\">remained at X</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CCNLdoI7ToB07Fxw5L8l7XWvgad\">Qatar&rsquo;s numbers were insignificant, and <strong>remained at around 0.5 million </strong>throughout the period shown.</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"3\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7stdDmtmoEvcbxAqYOlfAHKgZZ\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng tăng gấp đ&ocirc;i v&agrave;o cuối thời kỳ</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WjeodRLfAofyt2xYoIklOYXUgmd\">end up twice as highh</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OvGBdLFTKoS0bnxYMuhlmI6SgAP\">&nbsp;</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TVjIdcPVbohIM8xVvdylr1Ewg3f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Their all production capacity started at around 2 million barrels a day in the first year, increasing steadily over the next 20 years and <strong>ending up approximately twice as high in 2010.</strong></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 289,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DguXdLmgPobsTdxTnEmlrWgWg4g\">The given bar chart compares the oil production capacity of six Middle Eastern countries in 1990, 2000, 2005, and 2010.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13723,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 290,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G8MOdX7yEoHL8VxPvZJljvaAgBg\">Overall, it is clear that, with the exception of Qatar, all the countries shown expanded their capacity over the years, with Saudi Arabia being the largest producer, while Qatar was at the other end of the spectrum.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13723,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 291,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cuf6dyBoGoZaAAxKHaDlXdTWgbd\">Regarding the countries that produced the most oil in the region, Saudi Arabia delivered exactly 8 million barrels a day in 1990, and this figure rose moderately over the next 10 years, before surging in the last decade to 14 million in 2010. Iran was the second largest producer; however, in contrast, its numbers were relatively more stable. They started the period at around 3 million barrels per day, and then production rose slightly and plateaued at around 4 million from 2000 to 2010.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13723,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 292,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VFIMdcJZRo0FTaxPKlplMxMFgOg\">The next largest producers, namely Iraq, Kuwait and the UAE grew similarly, as their all production capacity started at around 2 million barrels a day in the first year, increasing steadily over the next 20 years and ending up approximately twice as high in 2010. Finally, Qatar&rsquo;s numbers were insignificant and remained at around 0.5 million throughout the period shown.</div>\n</div>",
